      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Oh yeah this would be a huge help, I feel like this is the main thing holding me back from uploading for iOS. I don’t want to have to go through every single texture and manually copy the overrides from Android to iOS, all a platform that hasn’t even launched yet.",
