  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A general question/problem - no system information needed for this.\n\nBased on a question to Three Bean Soup on the vrchat discord:\n\nThree Bean Soup:\n\n> I want to be able to say \"switch your build target from Android to iOS and hit publish again\"\n\nMy problem:\n\nNice, but how do you solve the problem with different build settings for textures? In my case normally the PC settings are on default and for Android i make memory optimized settings. When i newly make an iOS build i must manually set all Android texture override settings also for iOS.\n\nThree Bean Soup:\n\n> VCC doesn't automatically copy texture override parameters, but that would make a good Quality of Life feedback on our Canny please!",
